{"time": "2026-10-19T20:47:19", "event": "answer", "session_id": "s-6bab38a6f82e", "run_id": "r-a972eac887fa", "report": {"status": "answered", "question_type": "what", "interpretation": "Total claim payments with a payment date in May 2026 (1\u201331 May), using the agreed paid_amount metric, which counts payments by payment date. It covers motor and home claims. I excluded the 'reload-2026-05-16' batch because it re-loaded payments that had already arrived in the nightly batches.", "answer": "We paid out about $4,485,464 (AUD) on claims in May 2026. The raw warehouse total is $5,214,647. That figure is overstated by $729,183, because a one-off reload on 16 May 2026 loaded 84 payments a second time. I checked that all 84 reloaded rows match a nightly-batch payment on claim, date, amount and payee type.", "answer_sql": "SELECT sum(amount) AS paid_may_2026 FROM claim_payments WHERE payment_date BETWEEN '2026-05-01' AND '2026-05-31' AND load_batch NOT LIKE 'reload-%'", "findings": [{"claim": "May 2026 payments are $4,485,464 after excluding the duplicated reload batch. The raw total is $5,214,647, which includes $729,183 of duplicates.", "evidence_sql": "SELECT sum(amount) AS raw_paid, sum(amount) FILTER (WHERE load_batch NOT LIKE 'reload-%') AS paid_excl_reload, sum(amount) FILTER (WHERE load_batch LIKE 'reload-%') AS reload_amount FROM claim_payments WHERE payment_date BETWEEN '2026-05-01' AND '2026-05-31'", "key_numbers": [{"label": "Raw paid", "value": 5214646.93, "unit": "AUD"}, {"label": "Paid excluding reload", "value": 4485464.21, "unit": "AUD"}, {"label": "Duplicate reload amount", "value": 729182.72, "unit": "AUD"}], "confidence": "high"}], "hypotheses": [], "data_quality_issues": [{"issue": "Batch reload-2026-05-16 re-loaded 84 payments dated 2026-05-11 to 2026-05-15. Each one duplicates a payment already loaded in a nightly batch.", "impact": "A raw sum of May 2026 payments is overstated by $729,183 (about 16%). The agreed paid_amount metric does not remove these rows by default."}], "charts": [], "proposed_actions": [{"type": "ticket", "title": "Remove duplicate reload-2026-05-16 payments from claim_payments", "reason": "84 rows ($729k) duplicate nightly-batch payments and inflate paid totals for May 2026."}], "open_questions": []}, "error": null, "cost_usd": 0.087698, "seconds": 32.29, "models_served": ["claude-sonnet-5-5"], "fell_back": false}
